<h1>Kraken deposit information</h1>
<p><strong>Disabled — no provider requests or actionable destinations are available.</strong></p>
<p>This optional capability is independent of monitoring, trading review and the synthetic sandbox.
  Monitoring keys are never promoted. No owner is provider-verified by this screen.</p>
<ul>
  <% @capability.blockers.each do |blocker| %>
    <li><%= blocker %></li>
  <% end %>
</ul>
<p>Deposit Funds permission can authorize deposit-information operations; it is not permission
  for this application to debit a bank account, transfer from a wallet or direct funding.
  Crypto exchange deposit information does not fund a conventional securities brokerage account.</p>
<p>No deposits, withdrawals, transfers, address creation or trading are implemented.
  You remain responsible for any lawful action taken directly with your authorized provider.</p>
<p>Do not enter Kraken credentials, a Kraken account password or a wallet seed phrase.</p>
<% if @checked %>
  <p role="status">Application password confirmed for this check only. Capability remains disabled;
    no approval was granted, no credentials were saved and no provider was contacted.</p>
<% end %>
<%= form_with url: check_deposit_information_path, method: :post do |form| %>
  <%= form.label :current_password, "Current application password (not your Kraken password)", class: "form-label d-block", style: "max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: anywhere;" %>
  <%= form.password_field :current_password, required: true, autocomplete: "current-password", size: 20, maxlength: 1024, class: "form-control", style: "max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;" %>
  <%= form.button "Check local capability status only", type: "submit", class: "btn btn-secondary", style: "max-width: 100%; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere;" %>
<% end %>
